Subject: [PATCH 3/3] learning: Theorem 179.1 (b) proved

predictAdv_prfConcept_negligible: the prediction game is the distinguisher's acceptance
probability with f_k (step 1); with a random function it is within m(n)/2^n of 1/2 for
n >= 1 (step 2); so predictAdv <= prfAdv + m(n)/2^n, negligible by PRF.negligible_prfAdv
(budget m + 1) and negligible_polyExpr_mul (step 3). Module title, Main results, Contents
and the target's proof sketch updated.
